  "prompt": "Generate original pixel artwork sprite sheet 128x128, exactly a 2x2 grid of four 64x64 cells, transparent background. All each cell fills its 64x64 area apart from 3px padding; no text or labels. Top left: dark warm cocoa square tile with 2px bevel orange-brown border, subdued normal button. Top right: brighter orange square tile with pale golden bevel, hovered/selected button. Bottom left: dark desaturated brown square tile with soft muted edge, empty care-meter pip. Bottom right: warm saturated amber-orange square tile with gold edge and modest inner highlight, filled care-meter pip. Vanilla Minecraft pixel art, crisp square stepped edges, low noise, designed to stretch into horizontal HUD buttons/cards. Exact cell boundaries important, avoid shadows beyond cells. Actual artwork for Orange Pets shader HUD controls.",
